  "details": "Description\n\nThe personal mirror stuters/jitters while moving and or rotating your view on desktop.\n\nThis was not as pronounced in erlier versions.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Join a moderated big instance of 20 players.\n\n2. Turn on your personal mirror. (mine was set at 20 opassity, showing other players). \n\n3. ---> The mirror stuters and jitters while moving/rotating.\n\nP.s. might be related to Frame rate, but that was not as pronounced in erlier builds. \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1917-ee11595942-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-26_01-24-37.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_473ed0f1-ff0b-40f1-90eb-ed8dd289f9a5/1/file)",
